# plate.cam/geometry.part — geometry features for plate CAM project
# The notch cut out of the 120 x 80 blank's corner, through the full 20 mm:
# the ORIGINAL L's missing corner (x < 60, y > 40 — Profile1's loop since
# Phase 0 ran 0 0 / 120 0 / 120 80 / 60 80 / 60 40 / 0 40), drawn 5 mm past
# the blank on its west and north sides so those edges are open (the engine
# clips the loop to the blank and reads them as air).
feature Notch ProfilePocket(extent=20
    -5 40
    60 40
    60 85
    -5 85
)
